        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your hand presses into your target, leaving an imprint on its body. The target takes @Damage[8[force]] damage with a Fortitude save. The first time within the next minute the target's Hit Points are restored by a healing effect, that healing is reduced by 8. After any amount of healing is reduced, the spell ends.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half the force damage and half the healing reduction.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes the full force damage and the full healing reduction.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double the damage and double the healing reduction.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage and healing reduction both increase by 4.</p>"
